<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3654/59  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7036/39  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9170/80  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4708/18  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.13/17   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.7465/85  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1695.2/6.7 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     122.53/63  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6785/60  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.8060/20  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4995/15  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4335/42  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7941/46  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7428/38  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.5916/26</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$351.30/351.80</p>
</text>
